Sample tool table of the test data

This file is written for the tests of EH3D-ROUTEPRO and is not a copy of any other file.


This table contains 15 sets of entries with the format shown below.
The first data set is in line 20. The lines 1 to 19 are comments.
The tool data are separated by spaces.
Decimal delimiter is colon, not comma.

Format:

nn                           = Tool name (2 digits, numeric)
   d.d                       = Total routing depth (mm)
       ii                    = Number of iterations
          xxxx               = feed rate X/Y axis (mm/min)
               zzzz          = feed rate Z axis (mm/min)
                    sssss    = Spindle speed (1/min)

01 0.1 01 1000  1000 60000
02 0.1 01 1000  1000 60000
03 0.1 01 1000  1000 60000
04 0.1 01 0500  0500 60000
05 0.1 01 0500  0500 60000
06 0.0 01 0500  0500 60000
07 0.0 01 1000  0500 30000
08 0.0 01 1000  0500 30000
09 0.0 01 1000  0050 30000
10 0.0 01 1000  0050 30000
11 0.0 01 1000  0050 30000
12 0.0 01 1000  0050 30000
13 0.0 01 1000  0050 30000
14 0.0 01 1000  0050 30000
15 0.0 01 1000  0050 30000
